	abstract = {We report on a recently developed superior ITO-alternative transparent conductor, based on metal mesh technology. Trademarked by Rolith, Inc as NanoWeb{\textregistered}, metal mesh has the narrowest lines on the market ({\textless} 1 micron), which assures complete invisibility of the mesh under the most strict illumination conditions. It has also removed the necessity to optimize metal mesh design for each display structure, since it does not create a visible Moir{\'e} fringes, as do other metal mesh conductors on the market. We report also on ``best-in-class'' optical, electrical and mechanical performance of NanoWeb conductor fabricated on glass plates and PET films.},
