	keywords = {1-D, carbon nanotubes, effective subthreshold swing, electron volt energy 0.46 eV to 0.14 eV, energy bandgap effect, field-effect transistor, field effect transistors, Graphene, graphene nanoribbon tunnel transistors, lower off-state power dissipation, MOSFET, nanotube devices, ON-state current density, size 3 nm to 10 nm, subthreshold swing, tunnel transistor, tunnel transistors},
