	keywords = {Atomic and Molecular Physics [931.3]; Crystalline Solids [933.1]; Electric Components [704.1]; Electric conductance; Electrodes; Electron transport properties; Field effect transistors; FIELD-EFFECT TRANSISTORS; Germanium; GERMANIUM NANOWIRES; GROWTH; Hydrogermylation; LAYERS; LOGIC; MEMORY; MOBILITY; NANOSENSORS; Nanostructured materials; Nanowire surface chemistry; Others (including Bismuth, Boron, Cadmium, Cobalt, Mercury, Niobium, Selenium, Silicon, Tellurium and Zirconium) [549.3]; Oxidized surfaces; Passivation; Platinum; Precious Metals [547.1]; Semiconductor Devices and Integrated Circuits [714.2]; Single crystals; Solution-grown single-crystal; Surface chemistry},
