	abstract = {The fabrication of ultrafine GaN/ZnO coaxial nanorod heterostructures by heteroepitaxy and the characterization of structural defects of nanorods were discussed. The heterostructures were prepared on Al{sub }O{sub 3} and Si substrates using catalyst-free metalorganic vapor phase epitaxy (MOVPE). The structural defects of heterostructures were characterized using high-resolution transmission electron microscopy and synchrotron-radiation x-ray diffraction. It was observed that the strain between heteroepitaxial layers had induced defects formation such as misfit dislocations and stacking faults in order to release the strain. (10 Refs.)},
