	keywords = {Ab initio calculations; ADSORPTION; Atomic H exposure; Clean Si(100) (2*1); Dihydride intermediates; Electromagnetic radiation spectrometry (chemical analysis) (A8280D); Elemental semiconductors; Elemental semiconductors (B2520C); First principles quantum chemical calculations; Heterogeneous catalysis at surfaces and other surface reactions (A8265J); Infrared and Raman spectra and scattering (condensed matter) (A7830); Infrared spectra; Initial oxidation; IR absorption measurements; Metastable silanone intermediate; MOLECULES; O; O{sub 2}; O2; O insertion; Oxidation; OXYGEN; POROUS SILICON; Si; SI(111); Silanone intermediate; Silicon; SiO; Specific chemical reactions; reaction mechanisms (A8230); Spectrochemical analysis; Surface chemistry; SURFACES; Surface Si Si backbonds; Surface treatment (semiconductor technology) (B2550E); Surface treatment and degradation in semiconductor technology (A8160C); TEMPERATURE OXIDATION; Thermal activation},
