	keywords = {Adsorbed O atoms; Adsorption; Adsorption and desorption kinetics; evaporation and condensation (A6845D); Bonds (chemical); Dynamics of solid surfaces and interface vibrations (A6830); Electron energy loss spectra; Elemental semiconductors; ENERGY-LOSS SPECTROSCOPY; H; High resolution electron energy loss spectroscopy; HREELS; H terminated Si(111) surfaces; H-terminated Si surface; Hydrogen; HYDROGEN; initial oxidation; Local bonding structure; local bonding structure of SiO2; O; O{sub 2}; O2; Other electron-surface impact phenomena (A7920K); Oxidation; OXYGEN; Relaxation; Room temperature; Si; SI(100) SURFACES; Si H bonds; Silicon; SiO2; SiO2/Si interface; Si O Si asymmetric stretching mode; Si O Si bonds; Si O Si structures; Si SiO{sub 2}; Si-SiO2; Surface treatment (semiconductor technology) (B2550E); Surface treatment and degradation in semiconductor technology (A8160C); Vibrational energy; Vibrational modes},
